# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# B_rappa_LLGCSS .gitignore
# Large data / reference / index / derived files are kept on disk but NOT in git.
# They are documented in DATA.md and provided via the data deposit (Zenodo / OSDR).
# NOTE: .gitignore only affects UNtracked files; nothing already committed is
# removed by these rules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Reference genomes & annotations (kept locally for comparative genomics) ---
*.fa
*.fa.gz
*.fna
*.fna.gz
*.fasta
*.fasta.gz
*.gff3
*.gff3.gz
*.gtf
*.gtf.gz
*.gtf.zip
*.annotation_info.txt.gz
FPsc_genome/
Brapa_FPsc_v1_3/
FPsc_genome/

# --- Alignment / quantification indexes & intermediates (regenerable) ---
Brapper_fastq/STAR_index/
Brapper_fastq/RSEM_output/
Brapper_fastq/Reference/
RSEM_index.*
*.results
*.theta
*.stat
*.tab

# --- Bulky HTML reports (iDEP deg reports, multiqc, pathway workflows) ---
# ship via data deposit, not git. Force-add with `git add -f` if one is a deliverable.
*.html

# --- Large derived result tables (ship via data deposit, not git) ---
**/Results_LFC_Pval_DESeq2.csv
**/Radi_model_with_interactions_deg_values_DESeq2.csv
**/differential_expression*GLbulkRNAseq*.csv
**/Fixative_Results_LFC_Pval_DESeq2.csv
NewTest/B.rapa_to_Ara_mart_export.txt
# Large count matrices (raw counts ship via deposit; small factor/metadata sheets stay tracked)
**/RSEM_Unnormalized_Counts*.csv
**/GeneCounts_RSEM.csv
**/GeneCounts_Cropping*expression*.csv
**/TPM_RSEM.csv

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.bak
*~
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb

# --- Legacy archive stays on disk but out of version control ---
docs/legacy/

# --- Phase 1 annotation: large regenerable pulls (ship via deposit) ---
annotation/brapa_go.tsv
annotation/brapa_pfam.tsv
annotation/brapa_ensembl_genes.tsv
annotation/brapa_to_arabidopsis_orthologs.tsv
annotation/gene_annotation.tsv
annotation/id_crosswalk.tsv
annotation/_attrs.tsv
